<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasAwardDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The date on which notification is given or received that something, for example a scholarship or a grant, has been awarded.  [See also frapo:hasDecisionDate.]"@en .
